WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:06.940
You need two or three simple, single flowers, a hand lens, tape, and a sheet of

2
00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:10.780
paper. For the bee game, add coloured sugar and cotton swabs.

3
00:00:11.533 --> 00:00:15.513
Pull off the sepals, then the petals, and tape each ring to the paper.

4
00:00:15.953 --> 00:00:17.333
Find the stalks with pollen.

5
00:00:17.333 --> 00:00:21.053
An adult slices across the swollen base of the middle part.

6
00:00:21.767 --> 00:00:24.487
With the hand lens, look for tiny pale beads.

7
00:00:24.947 --> 00:00:27.447
Each one could become a seed if pollen reaches it.

8
00:00:27.867 --> 00:00:31.087
As the bee, your child carries colour from flower to flower.

9
00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:34.400
True lilies and daylilies can kill a cat.

10
00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:38.100
If a cat lives in or visits your home, do not bring them in.

11
00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:39.840
An adult does all the cutting.
